## 1. URL Rewrite Configuration Files

### `g:\.00.Tam-duc\urlrewrite.config`
**Full path:** `g:\.00.Tam-duc\urlrewrite.config`

This is the main URL rewrite configuration file using `UrlRewritingNet.UrlRewriter`. It contains **30+ rewrite rules** organized as follows:

- **Blocking/security rules** (lines 13-52): Blocks suspicious extensions (.php, .shtml, etc.), spam SEO folders (/video, /game, /doc, /apk, /rna), and malformed URL paths. Redirects all to `~/NotFound.aspx`.

- **Static file ignore rules** (lines 27-44): Bypasses rewrite for assets, Media, uploads, CSS, JS, images, fonts, and `.axd` files.

- **Preview rule** (lines 6-11): `/xem-thu-bai-viet/{slug}` maps to `InfoSectionDetail5.aspx` (draft preview).

- **Landing pages** (lines 150-155): `/tam-duc-page/{slug}` maps to `LandingView.aspx`.

- **Search** (lines 112-123, 369-392): `/tim-kiem` maps to `Search.aspx`.

- **Booking** (lines 135-147): `/dat-lich-kham` maps to `Booking.aspx`.

- **Events** (lines 162-177): `/su-kien/{slug}` maps to `InfoSectionDetail.aspx`.

- **Doctors** (lines 181-276): `/tim-bac-si`, `/doi-ngu-chuyen-gia`, `/bac-si/{slug}`, `/chuyen-gia-khoi-noi/{slug}`, etc. map to `InfoSectionList3.aspx` and `InfoSectionDetail3.aspx`.

- **Info detail routing** (lines 279-322): Complex regex rules with negative lookaheads route URLs like `/{slug}/` (for category 374 - Cong Bo Thong Tin) and `/{cate}/{slug}` to `InfoSectionDetailRouter.aspx`.

- **Info listing** (lines 327-411): `/gioi-thieu`, `/{parent}/{child}`, and `/{cate}` map to listing pages.

- **Fallback/NotFound** (lines 414-428): Catch-all rules redirect to `~/NotFound.aspx`.

- **Homepage** (line 429): Root `/` maps to `~/Default.aspx`.

The complete 437-line file content was shown above.

